OL,3,GNEWSAParents in Wales 'paying #1,000   
OL,4,Afor transport to school in England'    
OL,6,FSome parents are paying about #1,000   
OL,7,Ffor transport to a school across the   
OL,8,Fborder in England, a Powys councillor  
OL,9,Fhas said.                              
OL,11,FJoint leader of the council's          
OL,12,FIndependent group, Beverley Baynham,   
OL,13,Fhas tabled a series of questions to    
OL,14,Ffind out how many pupils travelled to  
OL,15,Fschools in Shropshire and              
OL,16,FHerefordshire.                         
OL,23,APub: 23-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2 
