OL,3,GNEWSAParents in Wales 'paying #1,000   
OL,4,Afor transport to school in England'    
OL,6,FCouncil figures showed 68 pupils were  
OL,7,Fin Year 6 across Presteigne, Knighton, 
OL,8,FNew Radnor and Gladestry in January,   
OL,9,Fbut 27 then went to Presteigne's John  
OL,10,FBeddoes campus of Newtown High School  
OL,11,Fin September - 45% of its total intake 
OL,12,Fof 60.                                 
OL,14,FBaynham looked into it after a review  
OL,15,Fof John Beddoes' catchment area raised 
OL,16,Fa proposal to close Gladestry Church in
OL,17,FWales Primary School.                  
